{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handstand Hank's demo starts in the seaside level, and takes you through the first few obstacles of the final game. You'll encounter 3 unique player altering obstacles and plenty of jumps to test your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handstand Hank is a punishing experience that will test your patience while you attempt to traverse your way up a mountain of obstacles. Jump, Fall and Rage way through increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546060/extras/handstand_hank_gameplay.gif?t=1743785960\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get Ready for a Challenge:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 brutality difficult areas, each introducing new unique challenges to overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lose of all your progress and potentially your sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unmatched triumph awaits those who reach the top.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546060/extras/english.png?t=1743785960\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546060/extras/handstand_hank_falling_shorter.gif?t=1743785960\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546060?t=1743785960","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546060?t=1743785960","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546060/94da5de3ecebd385c6fbc7a2f8b900bd2976d050/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743785960","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546060/94da5de3ecebd385c6fbc7a2f8b900